From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Martin Schmiedel <Martin.Schmiedel@tq-group.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 21:29:01 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: imx8mp-tqma8mpql-mba8mp-ras314: enable Schmitt
 trigger on HDMI CEC

CEC is an open-drain bus with slow edges. Without hysteresis the
HDMI_CEC input sees extra edges, and transmits fail at once with an
initiator error.

Enable the Schmitt trigger on the HDMI_CEC pad.

Tested with cec-ctl, 30 messages to the TV for each pad setting:
0x30 had 3 errors, 0xb0 (Schmitt trigger) had none.

Signed-off-by: Martin Schmiedel <Martin.Schmiedel@tq-group.com>
---
 .../arm64/boot/dts/freescale/imx8mp-tqma8mpql-mba8mp-ras314.dts | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/freescale/imx8mp-tqma8mpql-mba8mp-ras314.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/freescale/imx8mp-tqma8mpql-mba8mp-ras314.dts
index 06c865c..0d0edd1 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/freescale/imx8mp-tqma8mpql-mba8mp-ras314.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/freescale/imx8mp-tqma8mpql-mba8mp-ras314.dts
@@ -704,7 +704,7 @@
 		fsl,pins = <MX8MP_IOMUXC_HDMI_DDC_SCL__HDMIMIX_HDMI_SCL	0x400001c2>,
 			   <MX8MP_IOMUXC_HDMI_DDC_SDA__HDMIMIX_HDMI_SDA	0x400001c2>,
 			   <MX8MP_IOMUXC_HDMI_HPD__HDMIMIX_HDMI_HPD	0x40000010>,
-			   <MX8MP_IOMUXC_HDMI_CEC__HDMIMIX_HDMI_CEC	0x40000030>;
+			   <MX8MP_IOMUXC_HDMI_CEC__HDMIMIX_HDMI_CEC	0x400000b0>;
 	};
 
 	pinctrl_gpt1: gpt1grp {
